SUMMARY:Sober (Curious) Trivia Night!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Lose The Booze Crew (20-40s)\nHi friends!! Let’s h
 ang again at the Asheville Sports Club for a trivia night. You don't need 
 to know it all (just hope that someone on your team does). 😆\n\n**Trivi
 a starts at 7:00 pm.** Arrive around 6:45 pm to establish teams. There is 
 a 6-person maximum per team.\n\nAsheville Sports Club has a slew of N/A op
 tions\, please support our local business while you're impressing your tri
 via teammates with random knowledge about whales and NASCAR. 🧐\n\nMISSI
 ON: We believe in equality\, kindness and celebrating and encouraging othe
 rs to explore their relationship with alcohol.\n\nREMINDER: This is not a 
 12-step or recovery group\, just folks that want to hang out sans booze\, 
 regardless of the reason.\n\nDISCLAIMER: This is a public event. Asheville
  Sports Club serves alcohol. While you don't have to be sober to come to t
 his event\, we do ask that you refrain from drinking during our meet-up. A
 gain\, they do offer lots of N/A options\, which is why we love them!!
