SUMMARY:Spooky 5K Race
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Lose The Booze Crew (20-40s)\nLet’s get hella spoo
 ky and kick off Halloween Day with some movement 👻\n\nSign up below for
  the wicked weed spooky 5k race. **Dressing up is optional\, but highly en
 couraged!!**\n\nTickets are $55.49 before Sept 28th\, then they go up to $
 60.83. By signing up you’ll receive a long sleeve shirt\, finishers meda
 l\, chip timing\, and portion goes to a local volunteer organization: Moun
 tain True.\n\nPlease note this event starts and ends at a brewery\, so if 
 this is not something you’re comfortable with\, this event may not be fo
 r you.\n\n**They will have NA drink options!!!**\n\nLink to sign up is bel
 ow. Please RSVP to this meet up event after you’ve signed up.\nhttps://r
 aceroster.com/events/2026/111972/wicked-spooky-5k-and-creepy-crawly-climb\
 n\nPlease arrive early to mingle and take pics of our awesome costumes!\n\
 nPlease note dogs are NOT allowed to join runners during the race.\n\nI’
 ll see your beautiful spooky faces soon 🎃
